  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If I Lose**: back after 56 archived shows (493 days); rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Fire On The Mountain**: back after 136 archived shows (891 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **I'm Still Here**: back after 64 archived shows (527 days) [3]\n- **Steps**: back after 63 archived shows (526 days) [3]\n- **The Cuckoo**: back after 42 archived shows (389 days) [3]\n- **Ain't Nothing To Me**: back after 54 archived shows (491 days) [3]\n- **Don't Let the Sunshine Fool You**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **The Wreck of the Edmund Fitzgerald**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2024-12-29.mk4v.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 155 min [1]\n- **billy2024-12-29**: source not stated; 24 songs; 153 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2024-12-29.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]\n- **billy2024-12-29**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: SchoepsCM C4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [2]. Also: Recorded and seeded by Z-Man using Schoeps CM C4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Processed through Sound Forge 10.0 and CD Wave to 16-bit FLAC, tagged in Foobar 2000; taper's assistants were Erin Curry (first set) and Andrew Curry (second set) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena Nola 24-25 Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-24-25-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings UNO Lakefront Arena NOLA Night 1 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/uno-lakefront-arena-nola-night-1-poster-regular/) [6]",
